name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xoG-zabIUFngEhic1PEajA","review_id":"F_xR03QVotsMdaNmmTxJHA","date":"2011-01-05T21:13:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9489387273788452,"text_excerpt":"This was just a wonderful dining experience. I made my first trip to Upperline just after Christmas for the Reveillon dinner with a friend and her parents. I left thinking \"What took me so long to eat here?!\". I made reservations at the last minute and Ms. JoAnn took them over the phone. She was so pleasant and seemed as excited as I was about the dinner. I knew from just the phone call that we were in for a treat. Upon entering the restaurant, we were warmly greeted by Ms. JoAnn herself and shown to our table. My friends' parents could not believe how busy the restaurant was for a Wednesday night! A brief breakdown of the meal: Service: Spot on. Although the restaurant was very busy and ..."},{"business_id":"xoG-zabIUFngEhic1PEajA","review_id":"WjnH1c8_iEl1xkG-tJiwfg","date":"2009-07-05T22:55:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9464433789253235,"text_excerpt":"I love this place!!! I had some friends come into town and was looking to take them somewhere where they could really experience the taste of NOLA. I was going to take them to Jaques Imos, but the long wait and the fact that they don't take reservations for parties under five really left a bad taste in my mouth because it was just tooo hot right now to wait around for a table. So I came on here and did a search and liked what I heard about Upperline. I called and made a reservation and was impressed at how thorough the staff was. They asked me if this was a special occasion, if there was any special accomodations we needed and whether we needed driving directions. When we got there, it wa..."},{"business_id":"xoG-zabIUFngEhic1PEajA","review_id":"FIVpZJAkgtQRvdK-7uCfpw","date":"2011-04-30T08:09:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9428319334983826,"text_excerpt":"This is a wonderful restaurant, with a lot of warmth, some good food and a nice mellow atmosphere. the food isn't necessarily unique, but nothing is fried or battered or drenched in so much sauce that you can't taste it. it's new orleans' food in its simplest form, but with some interesting sauces that are always on the side. the restaurant is housed in a very old building, and the restaurant has been family-owned for 28 years (Joanne is a treasure, and a bundle of 71-year old energy), and the original art everywhere on the walls (even in the bathrooms) makes the place warm and gives it a casual feel. i would definitely eat here again. the $40 three course deal is definitely worth the mon..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xoG-zabIUFngEhic1PEajA","photo_id":"e--PnOWG8J6VDq-41RPvAA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/e--PnOWG8J6VDq-41RPvAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8719033002853394},{"business_id":"xoG-zabIUFngEhic1PEajA","photo_id":"tKloFZge8kDbOQj9dXl3Hw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/tKloFZge8kDbOQj9dXl3Hw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8689504861831665},{"business_id":"xoG-zabIUFngEhic1PEajA","photo_id":"bty00hIWj6rkIhrQ8sbKsw","label":"food","im